/**
 * @ranch/tack — master provider catalog for the sovereign estate.
 *
 * Single source of truth for: provider definitions (base URL, key env,
 * endpoint adapter per /models shape), live discovery, alias map, curated
 * cold-start seeds, and auto-quarantine. TS consumers import this package;
 * Go consumers use generated/providers.go; Python consumers use
 * generated/providers.json. Both artifacts are regenerated by
 * `bun run build` and verified in sync by the test suite.
 */
